---
---

<section id="about" class="bg-black text-white py-28 md:py-40 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40"
    style="background:
      radial-gradient(50% 50% at 80% 100%, rgba(41,151,255,0.25) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 60%),
      radial-gradient(50% 50% at 10% 0%, rgba(191,90,242,0.2) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 60%);"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-16">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <div class="text-[12px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent mb-5">
        Who we are
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display display-tight text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold">
        Local.
        <br />
        <span class="gradient-text">Honest.</span>
        <br />
        <span class="text-white/40">Built for it.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-white/75 text-xl leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        A local business shouldn't need a Melbourne agency to have a good website,
        a tidy Instagram, or a catalogue worth handing to a customer.
      </p>
      <p>
        We work with cafés, boutiques, makers, tradies and wineries in and around
        Ballarat. We meet in person. We answer the phone. We charge fixed prices
        so you know what things cost before they happen.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/55 text-base">
        We're new — and transparent about it. Which means hungry, honest about
        scope, and allergic to padding invoices.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
